  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/CpWXamx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WlrSbJp.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgottsch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gwa8kuz.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/gottschsmods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/se1ERhJ.png\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.amazon.com/hz/wishlist/ls/31YQP9T4H9NI7?ref_=wl_share\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EcaUQMi.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-fabric-mageflame/images/mageflame_title_v2.png\" width=\"994\" height=\"249\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>法师之焰是一个小型模组，它能让你创造跟随你移动的动态光源。</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>只需用原版材料合成的卷轴即可实现。无需法力值、没有技能点、不限定职业等级。制作即用。</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>第二版更新</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">Fabric版现采用<strong>LambdAurora</strong>出色的<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lambdynamiclights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LambDynamicLights</a>模组驱动动态光源，Forge版则使用<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamiclights-reforged\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium/Embeddium DynamicLights</a>。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">此次升级大幅提升了性能表现，带来更高帧率和更流畅体验。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><strong>其他重要新增特性：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">* 新增泡泡焰实体</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">* 新增烬狼实体</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">* 新增荧光球实体</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">* 召唤生物寿命HUD显示</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">* 可配置的多召唤物共存</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">* 优化的召唤物注册机制</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">* 通过物品提示与可选<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli</a>模组实现游戏内指引</span><br><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-fabric-mageflame/images/heading/entities_title.png\" width=\"226\" height=\"48\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-fabric-mageflame/images/entities.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1028\" height=\"324\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-fabric-mageflame/images/heading/items_title.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"48\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/wiki/gottsch/gottsch-minecraft-fabric-mageflame/images/scrolls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1028\" height=\"324\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-weight:bold\">玩家评测</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RGUOGMEnBsA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><h2 style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-weight:bold\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-weight:bold\">gottsch的其他模组</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/treasure2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Treasure2</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magic-treasures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Magic Treasures</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-denizens\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Dungeon Denizens</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enemy-echelons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Enemy Echelons</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/protect-it\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Protect It</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">Dungeons2</span></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeonblocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">DungeonBlocks</span></a>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">(与Minecraft Dungeon Blocks不同)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/39o2rdL.png\"></span></p>",
